        "description": "For customer and prospect calls. Listens for buying signals, objections, and anything said about price, timeline, or process — records what THEY promised as tracked commitments, stages what you promised as your own follow-ups, and leaves a summary a colleague could run the next call from.",
        "forked_from": null,
        "agent_config": {
